  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<pre><span>這是一個末日風格的模組，包含多種近戰武器，擁有獨特的結構與戰利品，並新增了自訂盔甲。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>- 在最新更新中，你需要化學防護服才能進入新的生態域。<br></span></pre>\n<pre><span>- 為了讓模組在 1.18.2 及以上版本正常運作，需要安裝 GeckoLib：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib/files</a></span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n<pre><span>&nbsp;</span></pre>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n</div>",
